    their surveillance gadgets and get out. Can''t let that tech be used on my town."'
  - 'You:

    "Looks like they''ve heard of some of the damage I''ve already caused.
    I''d bet they''re prepared for me..."'
  triggerOnStart: 1
  triggerOnce: 1
